* Edit 3: Add common-source stage after common-gate for cascaded gain
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM2 n4 n2 VSS VSS  ; Second stage: gate tied to NM1's drain
L L2 VDD n4             ; Load inductor for second stage
C C2 n4 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n3
NMOS NM3 n3 n3 VSS VSS
R R2 n3 n1
C Cbyp n1 VSS